        },
        {
          "text": " Kobu ediopet loabu koku, kolimok Aburam Eburaniat: ŋol loeboiene nci kaneeiaas iluan luka Mamure Emorait onaceke ka Esukol, ido onac loka Aner; kes da etutukitos Aburam. ",
