        {
          "text": " Kepupu Aburam ebe anata onaceke, kolot ka ituŋake Iuetuutooritai ejie, akwat auni ka itomon k lukanykauni, luaurikinio togoke, kotupasi aitodol Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
